BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  In ancient times, there lived a river spirit named Aquila who possessed five silver fish each ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    dawn. Along the riverbank dwelt eight villages, and each day Aquila would visit one village,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (     offering her bounty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  When Aquila gave her fish to a villager, the river's magic transformed them-each fish became t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    hree as it touched mortal hands. The villager could then choose: keep all the multiplied cat) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ch, or return some to Aquila's sacred pool.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  The first villages were fearful and greedy. They clutched every fish tightly, returning nothin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    g. Aquila still visited, still offered her five fish, but her spirit grew dim.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  Then came a village that understood the river's rhythm. When they received fifteen fish from A) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    quila's gift of five, they returned seven to the sacred pool. Aquila's spirit brightened, an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    d when she visited again, her generosity flowed stronger.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  The wise villages learned: trust begets trust, and generosity returns like water to the sea. W) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    hen both spirit and mortal honored the cycle-one risking their gift, the other sharing the m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ultiplication-the river never ran dry, and abundance sustained all.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  Thus, the ancients taught: what flows forth with trust returns threefold, but only when both c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    urrents honor the sacred exchange.) Tj ET
