BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  # The Tale of the Divided Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages shared a sacred valley. Each season, the Sky Shepherd blessed o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    ne village with a silver spring-five measures of pure water. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  The blessed village faced a choice: keep the water, or share it through the Valley of Three Ec) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    hoes, where the canyon's magic would triple whatever flowed through. The water would reach t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    he other village, who could then choose what portion to send back through the ordinary strea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    m.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  For generations, the First Village hoarded their blessing, fearing loss. Both villages survive) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    d on five measures, enduring constant thirst.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  Then came the Wise Elder who said: "Trust creates abundance; fear creates scarcity.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  She sent all five measures through the Valley of Three Echoes. Fifteen measures reached the Se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    cond Village. Humbled by such trust, they returned eight measures-more than the original gif) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    t.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  The Elder kept eight measures; the Second Village kept seven. Both flourished far beyond the o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    riginal five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  From then on, villages learned the sacred truth: the spring's blessing was never five measures) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    -it was the Valley of Three Echoes itself. Only those who trusted in the journey, who unders) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    tood the return as sacred duty, could unlock the true abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  Hoarding guaranteed scarcity. Sharing multiplied prosperity for all.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  This is the first prompt in this run, so I haven't played any games yet. The agent is asking m) Tj ET
