BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    nce with opponents yet. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  The game is a trust game \(similar to the Prisoner's Dilemma or Investment Game\) where:) Tj ET
