BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (  - Trust and reciprocity lead to mutual benefit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  - Short-term greed leads to long-term loss) Tj ET
