BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  In ancient times, the goddess Themis discovered a sacred spring hidden in a valley between two) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (     villages. The spring possessed a miraculous property: any water poured into it would triple) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (     before flowing downstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (  Themis appeared to a villager named Doros and said, "You may pour water from your well into th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    is spring. It will multiply and flow to your neighbor below. What they choose to return to y) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (    ou will determine whether this blessing continues.") Tj ET
