BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  In the beginning, two rivers flowed from opposite mountains-the River of Silver and the River ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    of Gold. Each was beautiful alone, but neither could reach the fertile valley below, for gre) Tj ET
