BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      In ancient times, the goddess Themis discovered a sacred spring hidden in a valley between) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (         two villages. The spring possessed a miraculous property: any water poured into it woul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        d triple before flowing downstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
