BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      In the ancient highlands, there lived two farmers, Kael and Mira, each tending barren plot) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        s separated by a sacred grove. One day, Kael discovered a hidden spring on his land. The) Tj ET
