BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages shared a sacred valley. Each season, the Sky Shepherd bless) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        ed one village with a silver spring-five measures of pure water. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
