BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        xt season. Mira, honored by his continued trust, returned even more generously.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      The grove between them became a garden of abundance, proof that prosperity flows not from ) Tj ET
