BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      In the beginning, two rivers flowed through a barren land-the River of Dawn and the River ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        of Dusk. Each possessed water, but neither could nurture the valley alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
