BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      In a forgotten mountain realm stood two lakes, perfect reflections of one another. Between) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         them flowed a sacred channel that tripled whatever passed through its waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      The Lake of Morning held five measures of starlight each dawn. A voice within asked, "Will) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (         you send all, or hold some back?" The Lake of Morning chose courage: "I shall give full) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        y, for cycles require faith.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      The starlight flowed through the channel, becoming fifteen measures in the Lake of Evening) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        . Evening faced the same question: "Will you return generously, or claim this abundance ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        for yourself?" Evening looked at Morning's complete trust and understood: "What was give) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        n freely deserves generous return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      Evening sent back ten measures. Morning received double what it risked, and Evening kept f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        ive-both flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      When dawn came again, Evening held five new measures. Without hesitation, it sent everythi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        ng through the channel. Morning received fifteen and returned ten, honoring the pattern ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        Evening had established.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      Season after season, they maintained this rhythm: full trust when giving, generous return ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        when receiving. Neither lake emptied; both deepened together.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      The elders teach: When you find a partner who honors reciprocity, match their trust with y) Tj ET
