BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        n more than Silver had originally given.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      The waters merged and surged forward, washing away the stones. Together they reached the v) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        alley, creating an oasis where all beings prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
