BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      In a forgotten mountain realm stood two lakes, perfect reflections of one another. Between) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (         them flowed a sacred channel that tripled whatever passed through its waters.) Tj ET
