BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      "Finn gave boldly when others gave safely," Elara announced. "Maximum courage deserves max) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        imum honor." She returned eight measures, giving Finn three measures of pure profit-not ) Tj ET
