BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      Galen poured all five threads before Elara. "I understand your wisdom of four," he said. ") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        Sustainability matters. But I have seen another truth: when everyone gives five and retu) Tj ET
