BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      "Perhaps," she said slowly, "four is the strategy of uncertain beginnings. But once the co) Tj ET
