BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      "Teacher," she said to Themis, "when Finn came to me in the third season, he poured all fi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        ve measures. I returned eight, honoring his courage. Now our paths cross again, with rol) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (        es reversed. Should I send my cautious four, or meet his boldness with equal boldness?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      Themis gestured to the Spring's depths. "Look at what you've learned. With strangers-Cyra ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        and Hana-you sent four. This was wisdom: substantial trust that invited reciprocity with) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (        out recklessness. They both returned eight, and you all prospered.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      "But Finn is not a stranger," Elara replied. "He proved his covenant. He gave everything a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        nd I honored it generously. Now, to send him only four when he sent me five would dishon) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        or what we established.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      "Exactly," Themis said. "Trust has seasons. The first season requires prudence-send four, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        establish the pattern. But when trust is proven, when both hearts have shown their fulle) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        st measure, then comes the second season: synchronized courage. You send five because Fi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        nn earned it. He will return eight because you earned it. This is how the sacred circle ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        closes-not through blind faith, but through proven reciprocity deepening into mutual abu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        ndance.") Tj ET
