BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      North River had long preached the Mirror Way from the safety of receiving: "Send five, I'l) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        l return ten, we both gain five." But wisdom demanded practice, not just preaching.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      So North River journeyed downstream as a traveler, carrying five vessels. At the boundary ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        waters, it met Galen of the Ocean Streams.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      "I come with complete trust," North River declared, pouring all five vessels forward. "In ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        my springs, this becomes fifteen for you. My philosophy says return ten, so we prosper e) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        qually. But I honor that each water has its own wisdom.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      The Council's teachings echoed: Ocean Stream returned eight from fifteen, creating differe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        nt proportions. Mountain Brook returned six. All sustained life, all embodied generosity) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
