BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      "Why differentiate?" the goddess asked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      "Because fairness means proportional reward," Dorian explained. "If four and five both rec) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        eive eight, why risk the fifth coin? The extra courage deserves extra recognition. Those) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (         who send five should end with eight total, not seven. This maintains incentive for maxi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        mum trust.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      Elara listened thoughtfully. "You honor all substantial trust, but reward complete trust m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        ore. While I treat four and five equally, you create hierarchy.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      "Not hierarchy," Dorian corrected. "Proportion. Seven for four is generous-you still profi) Tj ET
